09H/G14/G32/G37/G49B/G60B SA1 tables, pooled to the Northern Territory's 25 Legislative Assembly electoral divisions for the frame's election date. Each SA1 counts whole to the division its polygon centroid lies in (boundary SA1s are not split; the territory total is never moved). Bases match the federal and other-state stores (ex-not-stated; see the qld frame stores for the full per-lane specification). The industry picker (ind, key order in indKeys) reads the edition's industry-of-employment nineteen ANZSIC-2006 divisions, each shared over the divisions' own summed counts. p is census persons; n the SA1 count. The four NT sentinel SA1s (migratory/offshore/no-usual-address) carry no polygon and sit outside the join, holding 3592 persons territory-wide."}